ich we're seeing now is going to  made up  by extra production in the near future  europe's medical regulator is about to  decide  whether to authorize the astrozenica  vaccine come what may  germany will not offer it to those age  65 and above but make no mistake  whichever arms it goes in wherever they  are europe is  desperate for this vaccine and the heat  of this row shows  little sign of cooling adam parsons sky  news  sir belgium
 

